    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11821" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cūjusmŏdi</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quōj-</span></b> ), also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cūjus mŏdi</span></b> 
